WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.668 --> 00:00:04.004
Would you go out with
someone who wasn't a girl?

00:00:08.550 --> 00:00:09.760
I don't know.

00:00:15.682 --> 00:00:16.850
Maybe.

00:00:36.119 --> 00:00:38.497
Would you kiss someone
who wasn't a girl?

00:00:41.083 --> 00:00:42.084
I don't know.

00:00:58.934 --> 00:01:00.143
Would you kiss me?

00:01:18.579 --> 00:01:19.580
Yeah.

